# The agent guide is local, not published. Root-anchored so it only ever means
# this one file — a bare `CLAUDE.md` would also swallow any nested guide added
# later, silently, which is the kind of ignore rule nobody thinks to check.
#
# ⚠️ Untracking is not erasure. This file is in the history of every commit up
# to the one that removed it, and this repository is PUBLIC — `git log -p` still
# reads it. Removing it from the past means rewriting history and force-pushing,
# which breaks every existing clone. That is a separate decision, deliberately
# not made here.
/CLAUDE.md
